Chapter: Smith1998

 The June 1998 blacksmith menu (rundir scripts.wombat/blacksmith.m, draxinar's OUO), the rows and order of SmithModel:
 metal is the template's required metal (itemres.mul resource 44), the weapon and armor stats are rundir weapons/ by name.
 Arts and wear layers are the 1.25 TILEDATA.MUL entries of those names. Catalog ids: the dagger, longsword and gorget keep
 69 to 71, the broadsword and platemail the standard catalog's weapon 40 and metal armour 41 (their arts' items in
 gvb-item-of and cpr-kit-item), every other row 167 on. Categories are CraftGump's smithing labels: 0 Metal Armor,
 1 Helmets, 2 Shields, 3 Bladed, 4 Axes, 5 Polearms, 6 Bashing.
 The last three rows (axe, double axe, large battle axe) match no rundir weapons/ definition and come from UOX3 (Damian,
 2026-10-13): metal from data/dfndata/create/smithing.dfn ITEM 29, 32 and 33 (RESOURCE=METAL; the large battle axe's
 art 0x13FB is that entry's ADDITEM), damage and speed from data/dfndata/items/gear/weapons/weapons_t2a/axes_t2a.dfn
 [0x0f49_t2a], [0x0f4b_t2a] and [0x13fa_t2a], a damage range min..max held as 1 die of max - min + 1 faces plus min - 1.
